     5211   :
     5212   define buffer buf_doc-line-sum      for ub.doc-line-sum.
     5213   empty temp-table beforesumline.
     5214   empty temp-table salesumbeforesumline.
     5215   empty temp-table costsumbeforesumline.
     5216   empty temp-table aftersumline.
     5217   empty temp-table salesumaftersumline.
